    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VTuber-themed collectible card game co-developed by <strong>NinthGames</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Season Journey</strong>, <strong>PalaBoom8</strong>, <strong>PTS (Public Television Service)</strong>and its external partner Fuyera<strong>\u00a0</strong>, <strong>Dream City</strong>, and <strong>Akutagawa</strong>.<br>This game innovatively blends VTuber culture with strategic card battles. By combining traditional collectible card mechanics with real-time strategy elements, players can assemble powerful VTuber lineups and engage in intense tactical showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free to Play \u2013 All Characters Unlockable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> adopts a fully free-to-play model.<br>All cards are obtainable through gameplay\u2014no paywalls.<br>Jump in and start battling online with other players right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/604ff4647cc5ec40995f930f11718257.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/a4674e0ef4d87b55c997d7ce73c84819.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals &amp; Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every VTuber card illustration is crafted by professional artists, capturing the unique charm and personality of each character.<br>Skill animations, visual effects, and voice acting elevate the experience, making each match feel like a thrilling live VTuber broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/21e5b33d93339bd431c3aabf1048e66b.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/90fd5147c5ed05d0eb8be7cf1e777792.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About NinthGames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NinthGames is a pioneering studio focused on VTuber and game development.<br>We strive to merge the essence of VTuber culture with interactive entertainment.<br><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> is our bold new step toward creating a unique card battle experience like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/75aad8f38fbcb3808177b2c8cf6031aa.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VTuber-themed collectible card game co-developed by <strong>NinthGames</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Season Journey</strong>, <strong>PalaBoom8</strong>, <strong>PTS (Public Television Service)</strong>and its external partner Fuyera<strong>\u00a0</strong>, <strong>Dream City</strong>, and <strong>Akutagawa</strong>.<br>This game innovatively blends VTuber culture with strategic card battles. By combining traditional collectible card mechanics with real-time strategy elements, players can assemble powerful VTuber lineups and engage in intense tactical showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free to Play \u2013 All Characters Unlockable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> adopts a fully free-to-play model.<br>All cards are obtainable through gameplay\u2014no paywalls.<br>Jump in and start battling online with other players right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/604ff4647cc5ec40995f930f11718257.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/a4674e0ef4d87b55c997d7ce73c84819.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals &amp; Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every VTuber card illustration is crafted by professional artists, capturing the unique charm and personality of each character.<br>Skill animations, visual effects, and voice acting elevate the experience, making each match feel like a thrilling live VTuber broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/21e5b33d93339bd431c3aabf1048e66b.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/90fd5147c5ed05d0eb8be7cf1e777792.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About NinthGames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NinthGames is a pioneering studio focused on VTuber and game development.<br>We strive to merge the essence of VTuber culture with interactive entertainment.<br><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> is our bold new step toward creating a unique card battle experience like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/75aad8f38fbcb3808177b2c8cf6031aa.avif?t=1754966834\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
